<title>POLAND: Polish Atlantis bourse debut on June 4.</title>
<headline>Polish Atlantis bourse debut on June 4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Atlantis SA will start trade on the main floor of the Warsaw bourse on June 4, the bourse's president Wieslaw Rozlucki said.</p>
<p>In April the firm's five-million-share issue, priced at six zlotys per share, was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
